---
title: "temp_registration_flow (kintai-v3: Initial Schema)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_create: INSERT temp_registration record
    q_create --> q_set_fields: card_id, qr_token, expires_at provided
    q_set_fields --> q_check_unique: enforce UNIQUE on card_id and qr_token
    q_check_unique --> q_inserted: constraints satisfied
    q_check_unique --> q_reject_dup: duplicate card_id or qr_token

    q_inserted --> q_await_access: record created, is_used = false, accessed_at = NULL

    q_await_access --> q_lookup_token: user scans QR code, lookup by qr_token
    q_lookup_token --> q_check_expiry: record found
    q_lookup_token --> q_not_found: record not found

    q_check_expiry --> q_check_used: expires_at > now()
    q_check_expiry --> q_expired: expires_at <= now()

    q_check_used --> q_mark_accessed: is_used = false
    q_check_used --> q_already_used: is_used = true

    q_mark_accessed --> q_complete: UPDATE accessed_at = now(), is_used = true

    q_complete --> [*]: registration completed
    q_reject_dup --> [*]: unique constraint violation
    q_not_found --> [*]: token not found
    q_expired --> [*]: token expired
    q_already_used --> [*]: token already consumed

    note right of q_create
        INV-001: RLS policy allows ALL operations with no restriction (public access for registration flow)
        INV-002: card_id and qr_token must be globally unique
    end note

    note right of q_check_expiry
        INV-003: expires_at is mandatory (NOT NULL) - every token has a defined lifetime
        INV-004: is_used defaults to false, must be explicitly set to true upon consumption
    end note

    note right of q_mark_accessed
        INV-005: accessed_at records when the token was first accessed
        INV-006: Table is published to supabase_realtime for live UI updates
    end note
